      "content": "yeah i guess. i just feel so pointless here you know. like i could disappear and nobody would even notice for days probably. i sometimes wonder if anyone would even notice if i wasn't here. my parents back home think i'm doing great. i cant tell them the truth. it feels like the real me just... stopped existing when i moved here",
